The [[Online (open beta)|online beta]] received a patch on December 7th, 2023, announced on [https://twitter.com/tyronerodriguez/status/1732647152206442911 Twitter].

== Documented Changes ==
* Fixed "Disable All Mods" not letting you into online mode.
* Added delay to door that was entered so you can't immediately go back through it.
* Added player transparency option.
* Added player sound option.
* New compact pause screen.
* Text chat functionality
* Made it so you won't get a quick match lobby as a result if you've previously left that lobby
* Changes to countdown timer in lobby screen
* Beta now uses copy of save data so your main branch save remains untouched
* "A bunch of other small issue fixes"

